   "source": [
    "### Connect with Ollama locally and invoke model"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 4,
   "id": "48fb19e7",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "I don't have the most current information on the joining and renewal fees for the ICICI Emerald Card. Fees can change over time, and it's best to check directly with ICICI Bank or their official website for the most up-to-date information.\n",
      "\n",
      "However, I can suggest some options to help you find the correct information:\n",
      "\n",
      "1. Visit ICICI Bank's official website ([www.icicibank.co.in](http://www.icicibank.co.in)) and navigate to their \"Products\" section.\n",
      "2. Look for the ICICI Emerald Card product page and check for any fees associated with joining or renewal.\n",
      "3. Contact ICICI Bank's customer service directly via phone, email, or live chat to ask about the current fees.\n",
      "4. Check online reviews, forums, or blogs that discuss credit card products and fees, as they may have information on the current fees for the ICICI Emerald Card.\n",
      "\n",
      "Please note that fees can vary depending on your location, usage, and other factors, so it's essential to verify the information with the bank directly.\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "import ollama\n",
    "\n",
    "response = ollama.chat(\n",
    "    model=\"llama3.2\",\n",
    "    messages=[{\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"what is the joining and renewal fee of ICICI emeralde private metal card?\"}]\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "print(response['message']['content'])"
   ]
